<title>USA: SCALE - Alameda Cty, Calif., $307 mln taxable deal.</title>
<headline>SCALE - Alameda Cty, Calif., $307 mln taxable deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>MR Beal &amp; Co tentatively priced Alameda County, Calif.'s $306.83 million taxable pension obligation issue at the following scale, according to market sources familiar with the deal:</p>
<p>PRELIMINARY PRICING</p>
<p>ALAMEDA COUNTY, CALIF.</p>
<p>RE: $306,830,000</p>
<p>TAXABLE PENSION REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>DATED: 12/19/96</p>
<p>DUE: 12/1/05- 12/1/18</p>
<p>FIRST SETTLEMENT DATE: 12/19/96</p>
<p>WHEN-ISSUED</p>
<p>FEDERALLY TAX-EXEMPT</p>
<p>MOODY'S: Aaa</p>
<p>S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>CREDIT ENHANCEMENT: MBIA INSURANCE CORP</p>
<p>SENIOR MANAGER: MR BEAL &amp; CO</p>
<p>NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>    12/1	    Spread</p>
<p>Maturity</p>
<p>--------------------</p>
<p>    2005	    55.000</p>
<p>    2006	    55.000</p>
<p>    2007	    60.000</p>
<p>    2008	    60.000</p>
<p>    2009	    65.000</p>
<p>    2010	    65.000</p>
<p>    2011	    65.000</p>
<p>    2012	    65.000</p>
<p>    2013	    65.000</p>
<p>    2014	    65.000</p>
<p>    2015	    65.000</p>
<p>    2016	    65.000</p>
<p>    2017	    65.000</p>
<p>    2018	    65.000</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
